{"id":"vod_bf_1870","vodId":"1870","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"白箱","name_cn":"白箱","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-3/e696b50a6e20f9229065bd5489a4f303.jpg"},"summary":"所谓的“白箱”，是指在动画放送之前，专门制作赠送给参与了动画制作的工作人员们的录像带，其本身拥有着令人感动的悠久历史，因为这些录像带通常都被装在白色的盒子里，所以被成为“白箱”。　　一直坚守着自己理想的制作人宫森葵（木村珠莉 配音）、个性认真但有些懦弱的原画师安原绘麻（佳 村遥 配音）、怀才不遇的声优坂木静香（千菅春香 配音）、CG画师藤堂美沙（高野麻美 配音）和容易沉迷与自身兴趣爱好的剧本作家今井绿（大和田仁美 配音），五个个性迥异的女孩，朝着顺利完成白箱的梦想共同努力迈进，在这条并不轻松的道路上，会发生哪些有趣的故事呢？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-09 22:23:02","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"HD中字","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/baixiang/HD中字/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/baixiang/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/baixiang/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/baixiang/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/baixiang/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/baixiang/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/baixiang/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/baixiang/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/baixiang/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/baixiang/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/baixiang/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/baixiang/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/baixiang/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/baixiang/第13集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/baixiang/第14集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集",